   "text": "Engineering note\n\nToday the backend stores two notification switches per workspace (review ready, review failed). The personal choices on Notifications & reminders (which events, digest, reminder time, quiet hours, email) need a small per-user preferences API before they can work.\n\nFace ID unlock is device-only and needs no backend."
